<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
    <title>Charsac Technology — Structure Alignment (15m · 5m · 1m)</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
    <header>
        <h1>Charsac Technology — Structure Alignment</h1>
        <div class="sub">
            Raw ticks only — no candles anywhere. 15m sets the bias, 5m confirms, 1m triggers.
            All three read the same tick stream at three scales, so they cannot disagree about what price did.
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Connection -->
    <section class="card">
        <h2>Asset</h2>
        <div class="row">
            <select id="asset-select" style="flex:2;min-width:220px">
                <option value="R_100">Volatility 100 Index</option>
                <option value="R_75">Volatility 75 Index</option>
                <option value="R_50">Volatility 50 Index</option>
                <option value="R_25">Volatility 25 Index</option>
                <option value="R_10">Volatility 10 Index</option>
            </select>
            <button id="connect-btn">Connect &amp; Stream</button>
            <button class="sec" id="clear-btn">Clear</button>
            <button class="sec" id="export-btn">Export ticks CSV</button>
        </div>
        <div class="status-row">
            <span id="connection-status" class="status-badge disconnected">Disconnected</span>
            <span class="muted">Market data is public — no token required. Nothing here trades.</span>
        </div>
        <div id="notice-bar" class="notice" hidden></div>
    </section>

    <!-- Settings -->
    <section class="card">
        <h2>Structure settings</h2>
        <div class="row">
            <label title="How far back each timeframe reads, as a multiple of its own span. 20 means the 15m panel reads 5 hours of ticks.">
                Lookback
                <input type="range" id="look-slider" min="6" max="40" step="1" value="20">
                <span id="look-val" class="mono">20 ×</span>
            </label>
            <label title="Swing filter, as a multiple of the expected drift over that timeframe (tick sd × √ticks). One knob that scales correctly across 1m, 5m and 15m.">
                Swing filter
                <input type="range" id="k-slider" min="0.15" max="1.5" step="0.05" value="0.50">
                <span id="k-val" class="mono">0.50 × σ√n</span>
            </label>
            <label title="Internal structure is read at the major threshold divided by this. Higher = finer internal swings.">
                Internal detail
                <input type="range" id="inner-slider" min="1.5" max="6" step="0.5" value="3">
                <span id="inner-val" class="mono">major ÷ 3.0</span>
            </label>
            <label title="How recent a 1m internal break must be, in ticks, to still count as a live trigger">
                Trigger freshness
                <input type="range" id="fresh-slider" min="10" max="200" step="10" value="60">
                <span id="fresh-val" class="mono">60 ticks</span>
            </label>
            <label class="chk"><input type="checkbox" id="sound-chk" checked> Alert sound</label>
            <button class="sec" id="freeze-btn">❚❚ Freeze view</button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- The verdict -->
    <section class="align" id="align-panel">
        <div class="align-head">
            <div class="align-verdict" id="align-verdict">Waiting for data…</div>
            <div class="align-meta" id="align-meta">—</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tfrow">
            <div class="tfbadge" id="badge-15">
                <div class="tfname">15m <span class="role">major = bias</span></div>
                <div class="tfbias" id="bias-15">—</div>
                <div class="tfsw" id="sw-15">—</div>
                <div class="tfstate" id="st-15">—</div>
                <div class="tfev" id="ev-15">—</div>
            </div>
            <div class="tfbadge" id="badge-5">
                <div class="tfname">5m <span class="role">major = confirmation</span></div>
                <div class="tfbias" id="bias-5">—</div>
                <div class="tfsw" id="sw-5">—</div>
                <div class="tfstate" id="st-5">—</div>
                <div class="tfev" id="ev-5">—</div>
            </div>
            <div class="tfbadge" id="badge-1">
                <div class="tfname">1m <span class="role">internal = trigger</span></div>
                <div class="tfbias" id="bias-1">—</div>
                <div class="tfsw" id="sw-1">—</div>
                <div class="tfstate" id="st-1">—</div>
                <div class="tfev" id="ev-1">—</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Live metrics -->
    <div class="stats">
        <div class="cell"><div class="k">Spot</div><div class="v ac" id="stat-spot">—</div></div>
        <div class="cell"><div class="k">Box open</div><div class="v" id="stat-open">—</div></div>
        <div class="cell"><div class="k">Box high</div><div class="v up" id="stat-high">—</div></div>
        <div class="cell"><div class="k">Box low</div><div class="v dn" id="stat-low">—</div></div>
        <div class="cell"><div class="k">Box range (u)</div><div class="v" id="stat-range">—</div></div>
        <div class="cell"><div class="k">Box closes in</div><div class="v" id="stat-left">—</div></div>
        <div class="cell"><div class="k">Ticks in box</div><div class="v" id="stat-inbox">—</div></div>
        <div class="cell"><div class="k">Tick interval</div><div class="v" id="stat-gap">—</div></div>
        <div class="cell"><div class="k">Ticks held</div><div class="v" id="stat-ticks">0</div></div>
        <div class="cell"><div class="k">Alignments</div><div class="v gold" id="stat-signals">0</div></div>
    </div>

    <!-- The current 15m box, tick by tick -->
    <div class="secthead">The current 15m box, tick by tick
        <span class="muted">— every tick that has arrived since the box opened; dotted lines are the 1m marks, solid the 5m</span></div>
    <canvas id="box-canvas" height="360"></canvas>

    <!-- Structure per timeframe, all drawn from the tick path -->
    <div class="secthead">Structure per timeframe
        <span class="muted">— each panel carries TWO swing scales: <b style="color:#388bfd">major</b> (bold, sets the trend) and <b style="color:#a371f7">internal</b> (thin, the moves inside it)</span></div>
    <canvas id="tf15-canvas" height="200"></canvas>
    <canvas id="tf5-canvas" height="200"></canvas>
    <canvas id="tf1-canvas" height="200"></canvas>

    <div class="leg">
        <b>Everything here is the raw tick path.</b> No candles, no OHLC — the line is the actual sequence of quotes.
        &nbsp;·&nbsp; <b>Swings:</b> ● <span class="up">green</span> = swing high, ● <span class="dn">red</span> = swing low.
        <b>HH/HL</b> = bullish structure, <b>LH/LL</b> = bearish.
        &nbsp;·&nbsp; <b>BOS</b> (break of structure) = the trend takes out its own last swing — continuation.
        <b>CHoCH</b> (change of character) = the <i>first</i> break the other way — the trend flipping.
        &nbsp;·&nbsp; Dashed <span class="up">green</span>/<span class="dn">red</span> lines are the live swing levels: the
        prices that, if broken, produce the next BOS or CHoCH.
        &nbsp;·&nbsp; A swing only counts once price has pulled back by the <b>swing filter</b>, which scales as
        σ√n so the three timeframes stay comparable.
        &nbsp;·&nbsp; <b>Two scales, same ticks:</b> <span style="color:#388bfd">major</span> swings set the trend;
        <span style="color:#a371f7">internal</span> swings are the moves inside the current major leg.
        Read together they say whether price is <b style="color:#3fb950">IN TREND</b> (internal agrees),
        in a <b style="color:#d4a017">PULLBACK</b> (internal against major), or
        <b style="color:#58a6ff">RESUMING</b> — an internal CHoCH breaking back the major way, which is the
        moment a pullback ends.
        &nbsp;·&nbsp; 1 <b>u</b> = <span id="unit-note" class="mono">—</span>.
    </div>
</div>
<script src="../deriv-api.js"></script>
<script src="app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
